  "description": "Expose the dsh web UI on the LAN by forwarding HTTP/HTTPS and WebSocket to the loopback server. 局域网访问 dsh web UI：在 0.0.0.0:<port> 监听，把 HTTP/HTTPS 与 WebSocket/wss 转发到回环 web 服务器（默认 127.0.0.1:3080）。重写 Host/Origin 以通过 /api 浏览器信任围栏，仅接受 IP 字面量或 localhost 的 Host",
